  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On San Cha Mountain, she uses the Ten Tyrants as a probe to get close to the black and white demons. She drops the disguise and shows rank four cultivation; Fang Yuan then names her. Crowd voices warn that her looks are a trap and that she is ruthless. The earlier show was only a probe. His ice tone and cruel words chill her; she treats that as looking down on her appearance, takes offense, and leaves promising trouble.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "fac_ten_tyrants",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan knows she cultivates enchantment path methods, keeps puppets among Southern Border demonic experts, and holds a Gu from granny Mei Hua that complicates any plan to kill her. At this stage her enchantment path has not reached greater success, and the Gu Masters under her charm are rank four.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the disguise falls, she has a flirtatious appearance. Her alluring eyes are soul-stealing. She has a slender body with perfect curves, like a flowering peach in spring. She wears a pink dress.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a delicate little waist. Her skin is as delicate as jade. Her face flushes red. She has watery eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        344
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tyrant Heng Mei forbids the Ten Tyrants from picking a fight with her. He says she seduces men to their death, has a wide network, is involved with Lin San Chi, has rumors with Li Xian, and even with Mo Wu Tian. Those three are all rank four Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [
        339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "network-warning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tyrant_heng_mei",
        "char_lin_san_chi",
        "char_li_xian",
        "char_mo_wu_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Mo Wu Tian lands before her and speaks of a Gu Immortal treasure deeper in the blessed land, she abandons the green egg empress and helps him recruit a demonic army. He orders her to bring five hundred people, go left into the fog, meet lightning symbol dogs, hedgedogs, and corpse dogs, ignore losses, and charge north.",
      "chapters": [
        391
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dog-fog-charge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan refines fixed immortal travel Gu and the liquid metal fades, a commotion breaks out. Hu Mei Er and Li Xian are shocked and name little beast king. He then uses Fixed Immortal Travel to leave; the blessed land’s collapse is tied to spending the remaining immortal essence for that departure, after he is already gone from the scene.",
      "chapters": [
        405
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-liquid-metal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    }
  ],
